Package: apipak
Title: Local API Wrapper Maintenance Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person('Sean', 'Thimons', role = c('aut', 'cre'), email = 'sxthi@outlook.com')
Description: Development tools for local schema parsing, wrapper generation,
    generated file ownership and hook validation. Generated clients retain
    their own request helpers and hook execution and need no runtime tooling.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: cli, dplyr, fs, jsonlite, purrr, readr, stringr, tibble, tidyr
Suggests: testthat, httr2
